			"Message": "chore: Apply ARCH (Architecture) decisions - Verify and mark all ARCH items as verified\n\nARCH-21 to ARCH-30: Source Directory Structure\n- Verified all Rust Elements (Air, Mountain, Grove, Maintain) have Source/ with PascalCase\n- Verified all TypeScript Elements have Source/ with proper subdirectory organization\n- All Source/ naming and structure verified as correct\n\nARCH-31 to ARCH-40: IPC and Communication\n- Verified Wind has proper service-based IPC structure\n- Verified Mountain has IPC/ and RPC/ directories with Tauri integration\n- Verified Echo, Rest have proper binary structure\n- Verified Cocoon has IPC/ with Channel, Handler, Message, Protocol patterns\n- Verified Mountain has Vine/ directory with Client, Server structure\n\nARCH-41 to ARCH-50: Configuration Management\n- Verified all TypeScript Elements (Wind, Output, Worker) have Configuration/ directories\n- Verified Cocoon has Configuration/ directory\n- Verified Cargo.toml files use proper path = 'Source/Library.rs' pattern for binaries\n- Verified config files (ESBuild/, tsconfig/) are properly organized",
