			"Message": "fix(deps): Add Rest to workspace members and add missing dependencies\n\n- Remove Rest from workspace exclude array\n- Add Rest to workspace members\n- Add Rest-specific dependencies to workspace:\n  - git2, itertools, par-core (not in workspace)\n  - SWC dependencies: swc_common, swc_ecma_ast, swc_ecma_codegen,\n    swc_ecma_parser, swc_ecma_transforms_base, swc_ecma_transforms_proposal,\n    swc_ecma_transforms_typescript, swc_ecma_visit\n\nAddresses DEP-005: Rest workspace exclusion issue from Part 3 findings",
